{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月7日，第33屆Baron投資峯會在紐約舉行，特斯拉CEO馬斯克與巴倫資本創始人羅恩·巴倫對談時，談到了當年特斯拉進中國建上海超級工廠的談判內幕。按照慣例，外資車企當時在中國建廠必須與中方合資，外資股比通常不得超過50%。<strong>馬斯克回憶，談判前後持續了好幾年，中方堅持特斯拉必須找一位中國夥伴合資建立工廠。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585478.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.607129+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:28:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"db8e136059f893e44bd2a9d1081f7286676663a9360658b5b8e4ada0ebb7c67b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}